Do not create annotations based only on what the image was supposed to contain.

Generated photographs may omit or alter requested objects.

Always use the final actual image as the basis for annotations.

If accurate image inspection or annotation is not possible in the environment, flag the scene as needing verification rather than inventing coordinates.

